eness":0.9289774894714355,"text_excerpt":"This is way overdue. We had a GREAT evening at The little Gem Saloon about a month ago right after we moved to New Orleans and will definitely go back. It was a Saturday night and we had reservations because Kermit Ruffins was playing (one of the first things my husband wanted to do). When we arrived, a party of 50 had grown to a party of 70 (!) and I thought we were in big trouble. But the staff were so great, explaining the situation and wait to us and making sure we ended up with a wonderful table (I don't know how they did that but they did!). At first, no one came by our table to take an order (remember that party of 70?) and again, I thought we were in trouble. But I asked a passing..."},{"business_id":"J5wx3AY-jkOqt4sTDq2uGQ","review_id":"OJPBxsF5Qat_ALLWwRACBw","date":"2013-04-08T13:18:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9282792806625366,"text_excerpt":"we just happened to stop in for a drink and were pleasantly surprised. great live music and bar food. The bar tender could lighten up a bit ( from Northwest), but the service was great and next time we'll go for dinner. Very romantic. . We took a quick tour upstairs for the Jazz music and it look fabulous. $10 cover and terrific entertainment. OH biggest plus... they serve dinner till 11 PM!"},{"business_id":"J5wx3AY-jkOqt4sTDq2uGQ","review_id":"x3BtFx3R8RhxYGuLlNmmbA","date":"2018-01-08T17:29:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9226384162902832,"text_excerpt":"More of a large bar than a restaurant, \"Saloon\" is actually a rather perfect description, this place has a great New Orleans vibe. They also have an affordable $14 buffet lunch with fried chicken, BBQ chicken, collard greens, Mac and cheese, corn, and sausage/chicken gumbo. It was all hot, fresh, and tasty. You would be hard pressed to find a better deal for lunch in the area. The food won't blow your mind, but it's good. I also enjoyed the ambiance and old school jazz music playing and the bartender/host/server (one woman show other than cooking) was very friendly and personable."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"J5wx3AY-jkOqt4sTDq2uGQ","photo_id":"VyZc2DV2SGkP6ClswjtmDw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/VyZc2DV2SGkP6ClswjtmDw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8135019540786743},{"business_id":"J5wx3AY-jkOqt4sTDq2uGQ","photo_id":"Z2PPCz5t481orgIKro_ipQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Z2PPCz5t481orgIKro_ipQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7931569218635559},{"business_id":"J5wx3AY-jkOqt4sTDq2uGQ","photo_id":"P5htjqCe72JWmoMRSTUaXQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/P5htjqCe72JWmoMRSTUaXQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7926778793334961},{"business_id":"J5wx3AY-jkOqt4sTDq2uGQ","photo_id":"HZ6dMIrJsYFfj5FUcFc8dg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HZ6dMIrJsYFfj5FUcFc8dg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7913726568222046},{"business_id":"J5wx3AY-jkOqt4sTDq2uGQ","photo_id":"BfqMInOg3MPOElnOgFQeNw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/BfqMInOg3MPOElnOgFQeNw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7792203426361084}]},"notebook_case":null}
